    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Wisdom Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=KaTc2c6hOHAqtywC]], one [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=KaTc2c6hOHAqtywC]] the [[lookup @name lowercase]] can see within [[lookup @range.value activity=KaTc2c6hOHAqtywC]] feet.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average]] damage, and the target gains 1 &amp;Reference[Exhaustion apply=false] level.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Success:</em> Half damage only.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-uoh3tHmERuVKckmg\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature provides an <strong>Active Effect</strong> that will modify the target.  Since the <strong>Exhaustion</strong> condition can be applied multiple times, the Active Effect must be dragged from this item’s Effects tab onto the target item’s sheet after the initial application of the Exhaustion condition.</p></section>",
